<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Estvaal year taxed profit leaps.</title>
<headline>Estvaal year taxed profit leaps.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    After tax profit	55.58	 vs 9.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   73.03	 vs 13.77</p>
<p>    Tax			 17.45	 vs 4.55</p>
<p>    Sundry income - net   73.03	 vs 13.77</p>
<p>Full name: Eastvaal Gold Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said gold production in 1997 from the Moab lease area was forecast at 2.7 tonnes and capital expenditure at 318 million rand.</p>
<p>They said current production was at the level planned for 1997. The method of accessing deeper reserves is the subject of a thorough technical and financial review, results of which would be available by the end of the second quarter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
